app
  ?  ?  help  on

app
  :            :          command        on
  q ctrl+c     q          quit           on
  /            /          search         on
  B            B          history        on
  a            a          actions        on
  t ctrl+p     t          find file      on
  f            f          filter         off
  s            s          sort           off
  z            z          zoom           on
  esc          esc        unzoom         off
  ctrl+x       ctrl+x     dismiss        on
  @            @          owner page     on
  n            n          notifications  on
  0            0          dashboard      on
  tab ]        tab        next pane      on
  shift+tab [  shift+tab  previous pane  on
