Files
  r ctrl+r  r  refresh       on
  o         o  open          on
  H         H  back to head  off

tree
  up k      ↑/k     up            on
  down j    ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up       on
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down     on
  home g    g/home  first         on
  end G     G/end   last          on
  +         +       expand        on
  right l   →/l     expand/enter  on
  - left h  -/←/h   collapse      on
